{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>《OnSite Checklists》是一款供建造、職安、食品、設施管理等行業使用的巡查清單工具，適合審核員、承辦商、安全主任及設施經理自訂清單、拍照記錄、收集簽名並產生專業報告。現時<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，原價 US $0.99，適合需要離線完成檢查與合規審核的團隊。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-185.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>自訂清單離線巡查</h2>\n<p>用戶可建立自訂模板，編排問題與分類，並在現場以 Yes/No/NA 評分，加入文字備註、照片、位置地圖及審核員簽名。檢查可離線進行，亦可指派負責人、設定到期日及追蹤進度；完成後可生成帶公司品牌的 PDF 或 Excel 報告，並以電郵或雲端儲存分享。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-204-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-205-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-206-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-207-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-208-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-209-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：OnSite Checklists – Auditing</li><li>應用類別：Productivity</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/onsite-checklists-auditing/id1100209820?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T23:49:49.089567+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":333,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T23:33:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T01:10:49.161726+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T23:43:12.074392+00:00","content_hash":"e078cd5282cc08f36270418ef21abde232d4823acf43e0a69c88ab17f40f8869","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}